          }
        },
        "body": {
          "en-US": {
            "nodeType": "document",
            "data": {},
            "content": [
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "In July, it was announced that Davis Elen Advertising would be one of seven McDonald’s Co-op Agencies of the future. Davis Elen and the other six groups will be the only agencies authorized to do local McDonald’s advertising in the United States.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "The announcement came after a pitch process where over forty agencies were required to justify their capabilities. The process culminated in a live presentation in Chicago, where each team had to demonstrate their strategic, analytic and creative thinking on a breakfast assignment.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "McDonald’s made this move in order to better engage with its customers and create more cohesive national messaging.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Prior to this, 60 agencies had worked for local McDonald’s Co-Ops.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
